entries.english:
Your limbs are overflowing with morphogenic power, guiding your every movement.
Each other non-innate mutation you have also provides +1 EV and Slay +1 (up to
a limit of 7), improving your accuracy and damage with melee and ranged attacks.
This still applies even when the mutations would be suppressed by a different
form.

You currently gain
{{
    num = math.min(you.how_mutated(true, false, false, true, false), 7) - 1
    return "+" .. num .. " EV and Slay +" .. num .. " from this mutation."
}}
